WEBVTT

00:00:07.836 --> 00:00:09.636
<v><b>A:</b></v> Who was Andy Warhol?

00:00:10.113 --> 00:00:11.448
<v><b>B:</b></v> He was an artist.

00:00:11.806 --> 00:00:13.094
<v><b>A:</b></v> Was he English?

00:00:13.518 --> 00:00:16.582
<v><b>B:</b></v> No, he wasn’t. He was American.

00:00:16.936 --> 00:00:18.271
<v><b>A:</b></v> When was he born?

00:00:18.595 --> 00:00:21.021
<v><b>B:</b></v> He was born in 1928.

00:00:21.432 --> 00:00:23.118
<v><b>A:</b></v> Were his parents American?

00:00:23.316 --> 00:00:24.745
<v><b>B:</b></v> No, they weren’t.